'''Dannies''' are an enemy added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]''. They are exclusive to {{s|Mines}} and {{s|Ashpit}}.

They walk towards Isaac, periodically spitting a burst of rocks towards him, up to two of which may be {{E|Rock Spider}}s. Their rock bursts cannot spawn Rock Spiders if the two it spawned are still alive. Dannies have a long cooldown between rock bursts, but are more likely to use it soon after Isaac enters the room.
{{clear}}

