'''Coal Boys''' appear in the {{S|Mines}} and {{S|Ashpit}}. They walk towards Isaac, periodically spitting four hot coals towards him, one of which may be a {{E|Coal Spider}}. Hot coals linger and can hurt Isaac, but disappear after ~15 seconds, and disappear faster if they take damage. Coal Boys cannot summon coal spiders if the one it spawned is still alive. Coal Boys have a six second cooldown between coal spits, but are more likely to use it soon after Isaac enters the room.
{{clear}}

